    "## 1.2 Selecting values: `iloc`, `loc`, `get`\n",
    "- `iloc[...]` selects by **position** (0, 1, 2…)\n",
    "- `loc[...]` selects by **label**\n",
    "- `get(label, default)` selects by label without raising an error if the label is missing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 444,
   "id": "c773e1ba",
   "metadata": {},
